<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!IndividualApplication.PI_Name__c},<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Following the review of your application titled </span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">“</b><font face="arial"><b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">”</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">, the [Committee/Agency Name] has requested </span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">resubmission</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"> with
revisions. The feedback outlining the areas that need to be addressed is
attached.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please review the comments carefully and prepare the revised
submission latest by {!IndividualApplication.Due_Date_for_Resubmission_WIN__c}.&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Comments:</p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">{!IndividualApplication.WIN_Approval_Comments__c}</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Plea</span></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">se don’t hesitate to reach out to&nbsp;</span><font face="arial"><b>{!IndividualApplication.COE_Approver__c}</b></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;on&nbsp;</span><font face="arial"><b>{!IndividualApplication.Coe_Email_Address__c}</b></font><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;to assist with any questions or clarifications during the
resubmission process.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for your attention to this matter.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,<br>
<b>Wadhwani Foundation</b><o:p></o:p></p><br><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>